9d-q","source_order":[37,79,"P009d"],"order":6987}],"persons":[{"id":"pangfa-p0013","name":"法真","evidence":["pangfa-q-o010","pangfa-q-b-2fd1433f11a7ac250996"],"facts":[{"id":"pangfa-f0009","label":"字","text":"高卿","evidence":["pangfa-f0009-q"]},{"id":"pangfa-f0010","label":"称号","text":"玄德先生","evidence":["pangfa-f0010-q"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"高卿","evidence":["pangfa-f0009-q"]},{"text":"玄德先生","evidence":["pangfa-f0010-q"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"pangfa-m-o010-pangfa-p0013","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-o010","pangfa-q-b-2fd1433f11a7ac250996"]},{"id":"pangfa-m-p009-pangfa-p0013","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-p009"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"pangfa-e-p009a-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-d65b94ad659c2320b1d7","layer":"pei","quote":"常幅巾见扶风守，守曰：‘哀公虽不肖，犹臣仲尼；柳下惠，不去父母之邦。欲相屈为功曹，何如？’真曰：‘以明府见待有礼，故四时朝觐；若欲吏使之，真将在北山之北南山之南矣。’扶风守遂不敢以为吏。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ab97bd1f282ddc439643","start":38,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-p009b-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-d65b94ad659c2320b1d7","layer":"pei","quote":"初，真年来弱冠，父在南郡；步往候父，已，欲去；父留之待正旦，使观朝吏会。会者数百人，真于窗中窥其与父语。毕，问真：‘孰贤？’真曰：‘曹掾胡广，有公卿之量。’其后广果历九卿、三公之位，世以服真之知人。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ab97bd1f282ddc439643","start":131,"end":230,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-p009c-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-d65b94ad659c2320b1d7","layer":"pei","quote":"前后征辟，皆不就，友人郭正等美之，号曰‘玄德先生’。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ab97bd1f282ddc439643","start":230,"end":256,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-p009d-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-d65b94ad659c2320b1d7","layer":"pei","quote":"年八十九，中平五年卒。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ab97bd1f282ddc439643","start":256,"end":267,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-f0009-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-d65b94ad659c2320b1d7","layer":"pei","quote":"真字高卿。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ab97bd1f282ddc439643","start":13,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-f0010-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-d65b94ad659c2320b1d7","layer":"pei","quote":"友人郭正等美之，号曰‘玄德先生’。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ab97bd1f282ddc439643","start":239,"end":256,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-b-2fd1433f11a7ac250996","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-2fd1433f11a7ac250996","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗真：即法真（公元 100—188）。字高卿。好学，博采众家所长，成为东汉著名的儒学家，教授学生数百人。淡于名利，多次拒绝官府的征聘，终身不仕。传见《后汉书》卷八十三。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0db6a222c598dde8782f","start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-o010","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-6e63a04f86115cc81d8d","layer":"original","quote":"法正字孝直，右扶风郿人也。祖父真〖1〗，有清节高名。﹝一﹞建安初，天下饥荒，正与同郡孟达，俱入蜀依刘璋；久之为新都令〖2〗，后召署军议校尉〖3〗。既不任用〖4〗，又为其州邑俱侨客者所谤无行〖5〗，志意不得。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-p009","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-d65b94ad659c2320b1d7","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《三辅决录注》曰：“真字高卿。少明五经，兼通谶纬；学无常师，名有高才。常幅巾见扶风守，守曰：‘哀公虽不肖，犹臣仲尼；柳下惠，不去父母之邦。欲相屈为功曹，何如？’真曰：‘以明府见待有礼，故四时朝觐；若欲吏使之，真将在北山之北南山之南矣。’扶风守遂不敢以为吏。初，真年来弱冠，父在南郡；步往候父，已，欲去；父留之待正旦，使观朝吏会。会者数百人，真于窗中窥其与父语。毕，问真：‘孰贤？’真曰：‘曹掾胡广，有公卿之量。’其后广果历九卿、三公之位，世以服真之知人。前后征辟，皆不就，友人郭正等美之，号曰‘玄德先生’。年八十九，中平五年卒。正父衍，字季谋。司徒掾、廷尉左监。”","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ab97bd1f282ddc439643","start":0,"end":285,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
